WEBVTT

00:01:36.320 --> 00:01:37.240
Eigetsu-kun?

00:01:39.620 --> 00:01:40.820
Eigetsu is dead.

00:01:42.490 --> 00:01:45.040
He's not in this world anymore.

00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:08.480
Kourin!

00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:15.440
She's got a fever.

00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:17.360
We'd better take her to the village immediately.

00:02:17.740 --> 00:02:18.990
Princess, I'll do it.

00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:33.500
Hmm, this is bad.

00:02:34.090 --> 00:02:34.800
You-sensei...

00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:39.420
Her fever isn't coming down at all, and her consciousness is fading.

00:02:40.050 --> 00:02:44.050
I don't know what happened, but she must've had an unbearable shock.

00:02:46.850 --> 00:02:50.520
Above all, I can't sense her will to live.

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:52.310
It's almost as if she's empty.

00:02:54.190 --> 00:02:58.490
Sensei! Kourin will... Kourin will be fine, won't she?

00:02:58.990 --> 00:03:01.030
Only if her fever goes down...

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:04.490
Keep an eye on her tonight.

00:03:04.990 --> 00:03:05.620
Yes.

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:07.790
Kourin...

00:03:09.370 --> 00:03:10.790
It's understandable.

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:15.840
She loved Eigetsu more than anyone else, and he perished right before her eyes.

00:03:18.460 --> 00:03:19.550
Eigetsu-sama...

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:21.760
Eigetsu-sama...

00:03:27.260 --> 00:03:31.980
I'm sorry, Kourin. I've always depended on you.

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:35.900
Thinking that you'd be able to help us.

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:40.190
But, Kourin knew it as well...

00:03:41.530 --> 00:03:45.530
That Eigetsu-kun's life was coming to an end.

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:27.740
Yougetsu...

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:36.540
Another... Another of my dearly beloved children.

00:04:38.420 --> 00:04:39.290
It's all right.

00:04:39.800 --> 00:04:42.340
You can do whatever you wish.

00:04:44.010 --> 00:04:46.760
That girl... What about that girl?

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:48.720
It's okay.

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:54.520
Eigetsu was loved... by everyone.

00:04:56.230 --> 00:04:57.850
Human beings are so futile.

00:05:01.820 --> 00:05:02.730
Don't forget.

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:09.030
Eigetsu and I will always love you.

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:13.660
At least, I'll leave my heart with you.

00:05:24.460 --> 00:05:28.720
Yougetsu, thank you for giving me life.

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:31.300
That bastard!

00:05:36.940 --> 00:05:37.850
Why don't you come out?!

00:05:44.230 --> 00:05:47.140
It's because you did something out of character, Byakuya.

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:49.360
Just leave me alone.

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:51.160
You know it.

00:05:52.610 --> 00:05:55.700
There's one way left for you.

00:05:57.580 --> 00:06:01.040
Why should I go that far for him?

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:06.840
Idiot! You're saying that after you did all those things for him?

00:06:07.420 --> 00:06:08.300
You make me laugh.

00:06:09.380 --> 00:06:10.090
Shut up!

00:06:11.010 --> 00:06:17.810
For your information, when I saw you before the national exam, Shou and I seriously doubted our senses.

00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:23.820
Anyway, isn't it all right? Capriciousness is your speciality.

00:06:24.690 --> 00:06:26.820
It'll only be fifty years at the most.

00:06:27.860 --> 00:06:31.030
That's shorter than a blink of an eye to us.

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:36.450
I'm sure you can find time to emerge secretly now and then.

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:39.620
When you do, I'll bring over some quality sake.

00:07:56.530 --> 00:07:57.830
Kourin-san.

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:01.450
Kourin-san.

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:05.880
Kourin-san?

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:10.920
How are you feeling?

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:15.340
Eigetsu-sama?

00:08:16.050 --> 00:08:16.890
That's right.

00:08:18.100 --> 00:08:20.140
Yougetsu has given me life.

00:08:21.980 --> 00:08:23.810
Enough for me to die of old age.

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:36.070
Until then, will you stay with me?

00:08:45.330 --> 00:08:46.330
K-Kourin-san?

00:08:47.540 --> 00:08:48.460
I don't want to...

00:08:50.920 --> 00:08:53.760
I'll be an old woman by then.

00:08:57.140 --> 00:08:59.470
By then, I'll be an old man too.

00:09:00.850 --> 00:09:07.190
I won't forgive you if you ever disappear again.

00:09:08.610 --> 00:09:09.440
Kourin-san...

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:36.300
Doushu-sama.

00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:40.970
I will cherish the life Yougetsu has once again given me.

00:09:42.350 --> 00:09:46.140
Please watch over Eigetsu-sama.

00:09:54.730 --> 00:09:57.780
Spring is almost here.

00:09:57.780 --> 00:10:01.070
Yes, even in a village in a mountain valley like this.

00:10:01.490 --> 00:10:05.250
Well, it's arrived particularly early over there.

00:10:06.200 --> 00:10:07.750
To celebrate the love between these two.

00:10:18.300 --> 00:10:19.090
Good night.

00:10:20.340 --> 00:10:24.060
Please rest well, Doushu-sama.

00:10:28.270 --> 00:10:31.020
What? The disease outbreak has really been resolved?

00:10:31.400 --> 00:10:32.560
I don't believe it.

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:35.780
That woman governor is coming back alive.

00:10:36.280 --> 00:10:38.190
So it's going to rebound to her credit again?

00:10:38.190 --> 00:10:40.780
We must prevent that from happening.

00:10:41.190 --> 00:10:43.660
We'd better take measures at once.

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:44.740
Hmm...

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:52.440
So harsh... I'm supposed be the Emperor.

00:11:53.350 --> 00:11:56.650
I must not be practicing enough,
if just that makes me out of breath.

00:11:58.070 --> 00:12:00.650
You could have given me a bit of handicap.

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:05.320
If you wanted a handicap, you wouldn't have come here, would you?

00:12:06.490 --> 00:12:08.200
So, do you feel a bit better now?

00:12:10.620 --> 00:12:14.670
Without realizing it, I've gotten so much I can't give up on.

00:12:16.880 --> 00:12:19.460
Then cling to them. Don't give up.

00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:23.170
Keep on trying until the very last moment.

00:12:24.630 --> 00:12:29.060
Snatch everything you need to remain as Shi Ryuuki.

00:12:44.860 --> 00:12:45.570
What do you think?

00:12:46.110 --> 00:12:48.070
I think it's good.

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:51.080
These kinds of measures are necessary.

00:12:56.540 --> 00:13:00.670
I feel like I only do things that make Shuurei dislike me.

00:13:01.000 --> 00:13:04.630
It's all right. She's not the kind of girl who'll dislike you for this.

00:13:05.130 --> 00:13:07.050
It's great to hear she's coming back safe.

00:13:07.550 --> 00:13:09.140
Well done for waiting so patiently.

00:13:13.810 --> 00:13:14.890
That's enough for me.

00:13:16.230 --> 00:13:17.940
Just that is... enough.

00:13:18.900 --> 00:13:20.360
According to our investigation,

00:13:20.360 --> 00:13:26.860
Governors To and Kou both resigned their authority as provincial governors and proceeded to the site.

00:13:27.740 --> 00:13:31.370
In particular, is this not the second time that Governor Kou has shirked her duty?

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:34.370
She does not understand the responsibilities of her office!

00:13:34.370 --> 00:13:36.870
She forced through all these unreasonable demands,

00:13:36.870 --> 00:13:40.790
rushed through procedures unacceptably, and behaved irresponsibly as a provincial governor!

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:44.050
There is no possibility that we can overlook this!

00:13:44.050 --> 00:13:44.840
Hear, hear!

00:13:44.840 --> 00:13:45.760
That's right!

00:13:46.390 --> 00:13:47.220
All right.

00:13:55.480 --> 00:14:00.610
To Eigetsu and Kou Shuurei are relieved of their positions as provincial governors immediately.

00:14:01.400 --> 00:14:05.150
The current Kokushuu governor, Kai Yu, will assume this office.

00:14:08.780 --> 00:14:15.160
Kai Yu will depart for Sashuu at once, take over the
governor's duties, and proceed with stabilizing Sashuu.

00:14:15.950 --> 00:14:18.710
Regarding To Eigetsu, he is demoted.

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:21.000
Kai Yu will be his guardian.

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:24.170
He will be Kai Yu's pupil, assisting with the work and devoting himself to his studies.

00:14:25.510 --> 00:14:27.220
That isn't a demotion.

00:14:27.670 --> 00:14:31.680
It's more like promising him a future as a high rank government official.

00:14:31.680 --> 00:14:34.470
Th-Then what about the punishment for Officer Kou?

00:14:35.470 --> 00:14:38.850
After the transition, she will return to Kiyou immediately.

00:14:39.350 --> 00:14:42.650
Her official rank will be revoked, and she will be suspended.

00:14:43.730 --> 00:14:47.400
She will remain as a joukan until she is appointed to her next position.

00:15:04.540 --> 00:15:09.800
Shuurei and the others trusted Mayor Hei to deal with the aftermath and returned to Koren Castle.

00:15:17.390 --> 00:15:18.730
Now that I think about it...

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:32.740
What was that?

00:15:34.570 --> 00:15:37.120
Then Yougetsu-sama is now...

00:15:37.580 --> 00:15:41.580
Yes, he's gone into a deep sleep instead of me.

00:15:42.830 --> 00:15:45.710
He won't show himself anymore.

00:15:47.500 --> 00:15:48.880
Never?

00:15:49.340 --> 00:15:49.800
Yes.

00:15:50.920 --> 00:15:52.380
Even if you drink alcohol?

00:15:53.430 --> 00:15:54.010
Yes.

00:15:54.930 --> 00:15:58.640
He's so deeply asleep that not even his favorite alcohol can wake him up.

00:15:59.680 --> 00:16:00.810
Is that so?

00:16:02.100 --> 00:16:02.600
Yes.

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:07.070
So...

00:16:09.150 --> 00:16:12.200
Kourin-san, what I said the other day...

00:16:13.400 --> 00:16:13.780
Yes?

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:18.240
That I want you to stay with me forever...

00:16:22.620 --> 00:16:23.500
I really mean it!

00:16:23.920 --> 00:16:24.580
Okay.

00:16:30.920 --> 00:16:33.130
U-Um, I...

00:16:34.180 --> 00:16:35.430
Go on, say it.

00:16:35.930 --> 00:16:37.470
The words I couldn't say that time.

00:16:38.930 --> 00:16:39.430
Um,

00:16:40.600 --> 00:16:43.850
I... lo...

00:16:48.820 --> 00:16:50.190
A leech!

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:51.030
Huh?

00:16:51.280 --> 00:16:53.700
Ah no, I wasn't talking about you.

00:16:54.110 --> 00:16:56.160
I was looking for you, Eigetsu.

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:57.490
Ah, Ryuuren-san.

00:16:58.030 --> 00:16:59.830
Thank you for the other day.

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:00.950
The mood was really good just now.

00:17:00.950 --> 00:17:02.500
Who could've expected such an ambush?!

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:05.870
A man, of all people, takes over my place.

00:17:06.370 --> 00:17:09.000
My pride as a woman can't let this go!

00:17:11.090 --> 00:17:13.720
Now that I've finally found you, let's stay together.

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:14.880
I don't want to leave you.

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:16.880
Sure, stick around.

00:17:34.690 --> 00:17:36.820
Ryuuren-san, what was that just now?

00:17:36.820 --> 00:17:37.990
Why did the pigeons suddenly appear?

00:17:38.530 --> 00:17:41.410
When I was travelling, the street
performers taught me how to do that.

00:17:41.410 --> 00:17:43.660
He's just a weirdo...

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:46.620
That was amazing! Please do it again!

00:17:46.620 --> 00:17:49.500
I'm afraid it's only a one-time performance.

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:51.420
I can do it again when I catch some more pigeons.

00:17:51.420 --> 00:17:53.170
How did you catch them?

00:17:53.710 --> 00:17:56.740
When I was playing the flute earlier, they just fell to the ground.

00:17:57.300 --> 00:17:59.800
I wonder if they ate something bad.

00:18:03.810 --> 00:18:06.430
Well then, should we go capture some pigeons?

00:18:06.430 --> 00:18:06.810
Yes!

00:18:07.140 --> 00:18:07.640
Eh?

00:18:08.350 --> 00:18:09.810
Would you like to come along too, Kourin-san?

00:18:10.190 --> 00:18:11.190
What?

00:18:11.810 --> 00:18:13.570
I-I won't give up!

00:18:15.280 --> 00:18:17.280
Oh, so you've come, leech.

00:18:17.570 --> 00:18:19.910
I-I don't want you calling me that!

00:18:20.240 --> 00:18:23.630
Kourin-san and Ryuuren-san, which one is the leech?

00:18:25.240 --> 00:18:27.710
Embroidery... As in that embroidery?

00:18:28.120 --> 00:18:29.210
Yes, this.

00:18:31.040 --> 00:18:32.670
Will you teach me in secret?

00:18:33.040 --> 00:18:34.000
B-But...

00:18:34.590 --> 00:18:37.840
Just a tiny bit.  A cherry blossom petal will do.

00:18:38.300 --> 00:18:40.840
Um, I do know how to, but...

00:18:41.760 --> 00:18:45.720
A-Actually, I... Embroidery is the only thing I really can't do.

00:18:46.970 --> 00:18:51.350
A-Ah, I see... Well, that'll make it more worthwhile.

00:18:52.020 --> 00:18:52.980
Let's do it together.

00:19:02.660 --> 00:19:04.620
How is it going, Shusui? Have you finished?

00:19:05.030 --> 00:19:07.160
N-Not yet! How about Your Highness?

00:19:07.950 --> 00:19:09.460
I'm about halfway, but...

00:19:10.290 --> 00:19:12.000
Okay, let's show each other on the count of three!

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:14.790
One, two and...

00:19:15.960 --> 00:19:16.630
three!

00:19:21.470 --> 00:19:23.640
Are you making an embroidered floor covering?

00:19:24.260 --> 00:19:27.470
That's why I said I didn't want to!

00:19:27.470 --> 00:19:29.480
I'm much better at this than you!

00:19:30.530 --> 00:19:35.980
People are coming back to Sekiei Village, and the village has begun to revive.

00:19:36.690 --> 00:19:41.860
You're right. Mayor Hei seems to be working really hard.

00:19:42.320 --> 00:19:49.660
Most of the doctors who came from the capital say that they'll remain in Sashuu to teach medicine.

00:19:50.410 --> 00:19:53.920
They also said they'd be happy to assist us when we start setting up schools.

00:19:55.540 --> 00:19:59.050
The plans those two started are beginning to bear fruit.

00:20:01.260 --> 00:20:04.180
It's been hectic dealing with the aftermath day after day...

00:20:04.580 --> 00:20:09.310
Ensei! You'd better not be trying to play a joke by pinching her nose and waking her up.

00:20:09.810 --> 00:20:11.890
I'm just gonna put her blanket back on.

00:20:12.270 --> 00:20:15.190
How old do you think I am?

00:20:16.690 --> 00:20:22.700
Oh, Seiran, did you manage to find any sign of the escaped Hyou family magicians?

00:20:23.240 --> 00:20:24.610
None whatsoever.

00:20:25.320 --> 00:20:27.200
I don't know what kind of magic they used,

00:20:27.910 --> 00:20:29.950
but they've disappeared without a trace.

00:20:29.950 --> 00:20:31.200
There's not even a clue.

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:34.790
Nothing that might reveal their identity?

00:20:35.120 --> 00:20:35.670
No.

00:20:36.290 --> 00:20:39.750
We have no leads anymore, so the case is closed now.

00:20:40.710 --> 00:20:41.960
Our report will say,

00:20:42.420 --> 00:20:47.640
"An odd kid took advantage of the disease outbreak to stir up matters and failed, the end."  Full stop.

00:20:48.970 --> 00:20:51.220
Just like a lizard cutting off its tail.

00:20:52.850 --> 00:20:55.600
They tormented and hurt those two so much.

00:20:56.560 --> 00:21:00.400
Damn! We can't arrest them, even if we know who did it?!

00:21:00.730 --> 00:21:02.900
That's how the Hyou family does things.

00:21:05.200 --> 00:21:06.990
A letter has arrived from Kiyou.

00:21:14.500 --> 00:21:15.250
It's about the appointments.

00:21:17.670 --> 00:21:19.590
No, this can't be true?!

00:21:26.970 --> 00:21:28.590
It can't be helped.

00:21:28.590 --> 00:21:31.970
If it only cost two novice officers their rank, it's a bargain.

00:21:31.970 --> 00:21:33.890
Th-That's exactly right!

00:21:33.890 --> 00:21:36.310
We did it knowing this was going to happen. What's so new?

00:21:36.890 --> 00:21:38.020
Even so...

00:21:39.400 --> 00:21:44.280
It's true. I'm all right, but for Shuurei-san to become a joukan is too much...

00:21:45.650 --> 00:21:50.200
What's a joukan? Is it something bad?

00:21:51.030 --> 00:21:54.200
A joukan is a rank in name only.

00:21:54.200 --> 00:21:56.580
It means an officer who has no function.

00:21:57.710 --> 00:22:04.800
It shouldn't be possible for a person who passed the tough national exam to wind up in this position.

00:22:05.170 --> 00:22:07.380
It was decided at a meeting of the Imperial Court.

00:22:07.380 --> 00:22:08.550
Nothing can be done about it.

00:22:09.050 --> 00:22:10.010
But this is terrible!

00:22:10.010 --> 00:22:11.050
It's too harsh!

00:22:11.470 --> 00:22:13.310
I'm disappointed in our Emperor!

00:22:13.660 --> 00:22:16.180
Yeah, seriously! What was he thinking?

00:22:17.390 --> 00:22:20.230
Perhaps he was making a first move.

00:22:21.690 --> 00:22:27.070
A first move against those who dislike the services Shuurei-dono and Eigetsu-dono rendered this time.

00:22:27.380 --> 00:22:28.530
Even so...

00:22:28.900 --> 00:22:31.370
It's going too far. It's so heartless!

00:22:31.700 --> 00:22:33.870
It's okay. Thanks for caring so much.

00:22:34.450 --> 00:22:36.120
I'll be fine, so stop crying.

00:22:36.950 --> 00:22:41.960
You wouldn't know, but I've been quite reckless, so I think this action is fair.

00:22:42.960 --> 00:22:49.090
But... I got demoted, and Governor Kai
became my guardian, for doing nothing,

00:22:49.880 --> 00:22:52.970
but Shuurei-san helped others and was treated like that...

00:22:53.830 --> 00:22:56.970
It's all right, really. Don't worry about me.

00:22:57.390 --> 00:23:00.480
It probably means I should get some rest.

00:23:01.060 --> 00:23:03.110
I'll just look at the positive side of this, okay?

00:23:04.440 --> 00:23:08.740
Oh, yeah! I was thinking of cooking boar stew tonight.

00:23:08.740 --> 00:23:09.860
I'll go and prepare it.

00:24:46.170 --> 00:24:50.300
I've been dismissed as Governor of Sashuu, but I don't regret it.

00:24:50.800 --> 00:24:52.510
I think I did all I could.

00:24:53.050 --> 00:24:57.300
Maybe I'll take this opportunity to tour Sashuu before going back to Kiyou.
